<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\五島家お茶.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"That takes me back. It's been two years already. I've gotten totally out of shape now, though."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had made the tea. I took a sip.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It had cooled just enough, and a pleasant aroma and bitterness spread through my mouth.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why didn't you join a club in high school?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm, no particular reason, but I guess I just burned out!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Burned out...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I won't say I had zero interest in doing it in high school too. 
{PAUSE ""}
But I guess that was enough to satisfy me."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Because everyone acknowledged you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Acknowledged...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You improved that much by the end, everyone acknowledged you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hmm, I'm not so sure about that."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............?"</STYLE><PG>
"This might sound bad, but I was a little lonely. 
{PAUSE ""}
After all, I'm bad at sports by nature, and I was clinging on in that embarrassing way. 
{PAUSE ""}
But being able to push on as a team with <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> made a big difference. 
{PAUSE ""}
If I'd tried on my own, I probably wouldn't have gotten results, of course, and even if I had, I think it wouldn't have felt like enough."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Because you worked at it with me...?"</STYLE><PG>
"Vaguely, that's how it feels. 
{PAUSE ""}
And it's only now that I think this, but even if I'd become a starter, I think whether the team got stronger is a separate question."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why do you say that? Back then, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, you..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That kind of thing is done as a team, right? No matter how good each person is, without cohesion..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, that's..."</STYLE><PG>
"I know what everyone thought of me. 
{PAUSE ""}
If another me had been watching me back then, she'd have thought the same thing. 
{PAUSE ""}
That this person was painful to watch."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Come to think of it, you said so yourself. That you'd shown me your uncool side."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I knew it, but it still frustrated me. 
{PAUSE ""}
When even I couldn't acknowledge myself, there was no way anyone else would."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I still think that back then, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, you were really cool. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Even if you, </STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, can't acknowledge yourself, I acknowledge you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Heh."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It made me realize all over again that I really did want to be acknowledged. 
{PAUSE ""}
Not by anyone else. By you, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">... I knew it. </STYLE>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1">, you're an amazing person. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm sure you can stand up to any hardship. That's what I believe."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, you want to ask, don't you? About </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah... <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>'s said she'll tell me tomorrow, but I was wondering what you think, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"......"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> pressed her lips </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="つぐ">shut</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> too. Why are they both so unwilling to talk?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The tea's gone cold. I'll bring some fresh."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\盗聴器落とす.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">As </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> stood up, something small and black fell from her.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\盗聴器.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "500" "C" "100" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, is that... a bug!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　This is... um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had been letting someone listen in on our conversations the whole time...?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, I'm sorry... There are all sorts of reasons for this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hold on a second. Even so, this is... 
{PAUSE ""}
You're going to explain, right...? Everything we just said, the police heard all of it― 
{PAUSE ""}
No, since even before that, the whole time...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I gave </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> a slight </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="にら">glare</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The truth is... I've been in contact with that </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> behind your backs. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I thought it was strange. Why would the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">police</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> plant a bug?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Why didn't you tell me first? No matter what the reason, that doesn't feel good..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Since they're the police, I figured they'd put the bug there to protect us from something. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Senpai<STYLE ID="1">, when you both got in the bath, I talked to the bug. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Then I got the sushi by way of </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and had a note explaining the situation sent with it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">This is that letter."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\手紙.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> handed me a one-page letter.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">I wrote this letter with the thought that </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> might also see it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Danger is approaching. It is connected to the murder that occurred in Central Park this morning.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Tonight the culprit will likely come after </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Perhaps you will understand if I say: the culprit of the Megasawa City case.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">There is not much time, so I cannot write in detail, but the police have the area surrounded, so do not leave the house under any circumstances.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Goto-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s family comes home, get them outside at once.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"When I took the letter and the sushi, I gave </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> my contact info and the house key. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">This is an email that came afterward."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "C" "100" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Continued from the earlier letter.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">If the culprit learns of our presence, the culprit will not show.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">It is all right. We can hear clearly what is going on inside through the bug.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">If anything happens, we can storm in within 30 seconds.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">30 seconds is all we need. Hold out somehow.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">Also, I want you to keep the doors locked, but for some reason the culprit always appears right where the target is, never lets the target escape, and carries out the crime.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">It is probably some kind of trick, but even if you lock up, the culprit will likely get in.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">The culprit should appear before midnight.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm being targeted by the culprit of the Megasawa City case?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The police know it too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In other words, they mean to use me as bait to catch the culprit.</STYLE><PG>
"Why am I being targeted? Is it connected to this morning's incident?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't know either... But I think </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> might know everything..."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア早い開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="3">...!"</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "85" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "200" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内早歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組みアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"You idiot! I told you not to leave my side!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, in a </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="げきこう">fury</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, threw her arms around me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>... I've figured out most of it. I'm being targeted by the culprit of the Megasawa City case, aren't I..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">The bug and the letter, set on the table.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> seemed to have grasped the general situation from seeing them, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Sorry, </STYLE>Natsumi<STYLE ID="3">... It's my fault..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh...?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花覗き込み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"But the police and you guys, you don't get it at all! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　The shinigami isn't human! There's no way they can catch it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>, calm down. If you know about the culprit, tell me."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> sat down as I soothed her.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"The shinigami is a demon summoned by a witch. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">When a witch puts a curse on someone she wants dead, it appears only on April 8, and it always kills that person."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A witch... what? 
{PAUSE ""}
　That witch wanted to kill me, so she put a curse on me? Who is that...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I told you! I said I'd tell you about that tomorrow...!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "200" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Kogori-senpai<STYLE ID="1">. Right now, that isn't important. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Let's focus only on holding out for 30 seconds."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was obviously changing the subject...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> must know too.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\椅子から立つ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="12">"Hey, who is it!? Who's the witch!?"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I stood up and shouted.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"The witch is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">me...!"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "忍び寄る影.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> kept her head down, not meeting my eyes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was looking away too.</STYLE><PG>
"Um... 
{PAUSE ""}
that joke isn't funny...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> both stayed as they were.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">What is this...? Why are the two of them keeping quiet?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s the witch? </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> wants to kill me?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is aware of it? The police, all of them, know it?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPS>What did I do to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?　I don't remember doing anything to be </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">resented</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> for.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But she's put a curse on me and is trying to summon </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">something not human</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Surely not.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is keeping quiet too.　</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> also thinks </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is the </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">witch</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "100"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000080" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n0\r\n10000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<STYLE ID="14">Lies</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">! That's all </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">lies</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">But Haruka never said a thing about something that important.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">She said she wanted it to be just the two of us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">Was that to </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">kill</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> me?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">So that, with no one to interfere, the shinigami could </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">kill</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> me?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">And if she had me come to Goto's house, then Goto's an </STYLE><STYLE ID="14">accomplice</STYLE><STYLE ID="13"> too?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="13"><TXSPD TIME="100">No, no! The two of them would never do something like that...!</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">Haruka and Goto are both people who matter to me</STYLE><STYLE ID="13">!</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">But... </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="13">but even the police are moving...!</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">I don't know...!</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="13">I... </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="13">who am I supposed to trust...?</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
